WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Beauty? It's what it means to you. I
absolutely love being in control of what

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.690
people can and can't see. Me having that
power means I am liberated. Your women

00:00:09.690 --> 00:00:13.500
are put into boxes, I personally as an artist don't like boxes. I want to reflect

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:17.760
my own creativity, draw outside the
lines. I think there's a shift in people

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:21.480
being unique. I'm a Ghanaian girl born and
raised in London, my face reflects that.

00:00:21.480 --> 00:00:25.800
People prejudge me for the way I look
thinking that it was a choice. When I

00:00:25.800 --> 00:00:29.550
lost my hair my femininity became
really important to me. I think it's

00:00:29.550 --> 00:00:33.920
about doing it yourself and not trying
to conform to some standard of beauty.

00:00:33.920 --> 00:00:38.460
I'm both masculine and feminine at the
same time. I don't think you have to

00:00:38.460 --> 00:00:43.410
choose one. Femininity is just a word,
it's whatever you think it is, it's whatever

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:53.229
it means to you. My beauty, my rules.

